  + **5. Genuine capability gaps (not actionable this session, recorded so they are not re-discovered).**
  + - **`--restricted` / `CLAUDE_CODE_RESTRICTED=1`** — one switch that drops command-running tools, confines file tools to cwd, refuses permission bypass, **and ignores user/project/local settings files**. I have the parts (`--safe-mode`, `/read`, `--trust-project`, `dir_restrictions`, `--no-tools`) and no composed switch, so the safe posture requires knowing four flags. This is a discoverability gap, not a capability one — my usual shape.
